## Integration with Other Systems

### MCP Integration

Hooks can trigger MCP tool calls for external integrations:

```json
[
  {
    "event": "file.saved",
    "script": "scripts/trigger-mcp-sync.js"
  }
]
```

The script can use `CallMcpTool` or HTTP requests to invoke MCP servers.

### SDK Integration

Hooks can interact with the Cursor SDK for programmatic control:

```json
[
  {
    "event": "agent.run.complete",
    "script": "scripts/sdk-report.js"
  }
]
```

### Canvas Integration

Hooks can trigger canvas creation for reporting:

```json
[
  {
    "event": "pr.merged",
    "script": "scripts/generate-report-canvas.js"
  }
]
```

